{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと人生初"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに髪きちゃいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/10/29/1252273/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前下がりボブさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/10/29/1252273/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーほんと短い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までの人生ショートは似合わない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われてきたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子はロング正義だと思ってたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"挑戦しちゃいました。(なんとなく)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫かな、失敗と言われたらどうしよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ慣れない。ね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ誰も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この髪型見てないので反応気になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず一時、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前下がりボブです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの反応みてみます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/10/29/1252273/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感想ください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしゅう。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/10/29/1252273/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/10/29/1252273/0003.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}